---
// The site footer.
---

<footer class="foot on-ink">
  <div class="wrap foot-in">
    <p>
      Every action links to its sources and to the vote. Each entry is drafted by one AI model and checked by a model from
      a different company. <a href="/how-we-check/">How we check</a>.
    </p>
    <p>Faces are ink illustrations drawn from real photos. Each drawing links to the page its photo came from.</p>
    <p>
      Something wrong or missing? <a href="mailto:corrections@whatdidgovtdofor.you">Send a correction</a>. Follow new
      actions with the <a href="/feed.xml">RSS feed</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .foot {
    padding-block: 2.5rem 3rem;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .foot-in {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  .foot-in p {
    max-width: var(--measure);
  }
</style>
